# da ghi results/r4_3_bound_constants.csv (6 dong)

=== MENH DE 1 NOI DUOC GI, BANG SO ===
  H (so chang dai nhat cua duong da giai ma) = 20
  c1*H tai tai UE     = 74
  c1*H tai tai blind  = 2,969

  Chan la TTT(pi) <= (1 + delta_dec + c1*H*eps) * TTT*.
  De phan du doan co nghia (vi du dong gop duoi 10%) thi can eps <= 0.1/(c1*H):
    tai UE    : eps <= 1.35e-03
    tai blind : eps <= 3.37e-05

  => Sai so gia tren MOI lien ket phai duoi muc do thi chan moi noi duoc dieu gi.
     Do la nguong ma khong mo hinh hoc nao trong bai nay dat toi, ke ca tren vo
     huan luyen. Menh de 1 vi vay la mot phat bieu ve DANG (sai so gia -> sai so
     dinh tuyen, tuyen tinh, tat dan ve delta_dec), KHONG phai mot chan dung duoc.
